&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://maps.app.goo.gl/WNeRhfvAc8vBynKe9&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hofstatt&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/a&gt; Hackenstr. 2, 80331 München&lt;/li&gt;
