&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;2xpsyh&quot; data-start=&quot;3094&quot; data-end=&quot;3161&quot;&gt;Prior leadership experience managing HR staff or teams preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
