&lt;li data-start=&quot;2280&quot; data-end=&quot;2334&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2282&quot; data-end=&quot;2334&quot;&gt;Ability to manage multiple deadlines independently&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2335&quot; data-end=&quot;2388&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2337&quot; data-end=&quot;2388&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/p&gt;
